ter-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-306103 kbt.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/91/Spine_static-306103_kbt.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"541\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"229\" data-file-height=\"541\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg orange.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dc/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_orange.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">全新神秘术特效</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg purple.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">全新战斗入场效果</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3061\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%90%E6%80%96%E9%80%9A\" title=\"恐怖通\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%90%E6%80%96%E9%80%9A\" title=\"恐怖通\"><img alt=\"恐怖通\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-306101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/36/HeadIconSmall-306101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%90%E6%80%96%E9%80%9A\" title=\"恐怖通\">恐怖通</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>红尘我为客</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：306103</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">这是道士第一次独自行动，他盼望这个机会已经很久。<br />之前，受制于师门之令，他总和一位师姐一起行动。那名师姐总有些稀奇古怪的做法方式，譬如用糖果打鬼，让人摸不着头脑。更令人匪夷所思的是，那些方法还十分奏效，小鬼们被打得抱头求饶。<br />他曾经偷偷按照师姐的方式尝试过，却毫无头绪，想来是什么独门秘技，不足为外人道也。<br />而现在，他来到了一个年久失修的破庙。据附近的传言，这里有一只道行高深的妖怪——他为此做了充足的准备，光桃木剑就带了三把，以及数张可以缩地成寸的符咒。<br />实在打不过，就走为上策咯。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"306103\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306104.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2d/Belonging-306104.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">鬼差马面<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Ritual Mask</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>怒目圆睁的马脸面具，据说受访者能凭此物借用冥界使者的力量以压制邪祟。面具口中长长的布带如同舌头一般垂坠而下，令人想起某种吊亡鬼魂的传说。<br />“怎么会是舌头呢？这上面只是写了些符箓而已。你看，喏——别走啊！”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306105.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4b/Belonging-306105.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">邪木剑<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Restless Wooden Sword</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在某次事件中饮下太多怨念后变得扭曲的木剑，远看仿佛一条硬质的触手盘虬在受访者臂弯，剑身残留的红褐色已深深沁入木纹中。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-306106.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/94/Belonging-306106.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">摄魂铃<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Bell of the Haunted</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>大大小小凌乱串起的黄铜铃铛，能震慑邪灵恶鬼。其外侧所串的一圈潦草黄符，则在传统神秘学仪式中起到定神安魂的作用。<br />“这两者当然不矛盾，我总要提防它把我的魂魄也摄走嘛。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 疯道人1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 疯道人2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%96%AF%E9%81%93%E4%BA%BA2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">疯道人 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Daoist's Madness</small></span></span>"}}